{"id":128,"date":"2026-07-09T14:28:15","date_gmt":"2026-07-09T14:28:15","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/localhost:8181\/healthy-air-for-busy-hershey-households-a-practical-qa\/"},"modified":"2026-07-14T19:43:54","modified_gmt":"2026-07-14T19:43:54","slug":"healthy-air-for-busy-hershey-households-a-practical-qa","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/healthy-air-for-busy-hershey-households-a-practical-qa\/","title":{"rendered":"The Chocolate Factory Makes Your Hershey Home Humid \u2014 Not Sweet"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull s-hero-cover\" style=\"padding-top:3rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:3rem;padding-left:2rem\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-contrast-background-color has-background-dim-70 has-background-dim\"><\/span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-1767\" alt=\"condenser - professional HVAC service photo\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-condenser-1.png\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-condenser-1.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-condenser-1-300x300.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-condenser-1-150x150.png 150w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-condenser-1-768x768.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-cover-is-layout-ff0c90b8 wp-block-cover-is-layout-constrained\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-element-heading has-text-align-center has-base-color has-text-color s-hero-cover__title wp-block-heading\">Comfort without the humidity.<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center s-lead has-base-color has-text-color has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Company towns built homes in identical rows, but the chocolate factory next door adds a humidity problem no subdivision was designed to handle.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-35f06ea7 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/contact\/\">Schedule the Walkthrough<\/a><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#content\">Learn More<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"s-trust-bar\"><div class=\"s-trust__item\">15+ Years Serving PA<\/div><div class=\"s-trust__item\">Licensed &amp; Insured<\/div><div class=\"s-trust__item\">Same-Day Emergency<\/div><div class=\"s-trust__item\">Local to Your Area<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull s-band s-band--sand has-tint-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hershey&#039;s uniform housing stock needs humidity solutions.<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Hershey&#039;s planned community architecture\u2014Colonial Revival homes along tree-lined streets, laid out with geometric precision in the early twentieth century\u2014promised orderly comfort. Milton Hershey&#039;s vision included not just housing but infrastructure: central water, electric service, and eventually natural gas. The homes were built to a consistent standard, which means their HVAC challenges are also consistent. The original heating systems were coal-fired, later converted to oil or gas.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ductwork, where it exists, was added in the 1960s and 70s, sized by contractors who worked block by block, often using the same equipment and layout for every house. The result is a housing stock with predictable mechanical issues: undersized cooling, humidity problems, and systems that cycle inefficiently.<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text\" style=\"grid-template-columns:50% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-filter-1-1024x683.png\" alt=\"filter - professional HVAC service photo\" class=\"wp-image-1487\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-filter-1-1024x683.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-filter-1-300x200.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-filter-1-768x512.png 768w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-filter-1.png 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gpt-image-1)\">AI<\/span><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why temperature and humidity aren&#039;t the same.<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Temperature and humidity are separate variables, but most homeowners treat them as one. A house at 75 degrees and 50 percent relative humidity feels comfortable. The same house at 75 degrees and 70 percent humidity feels oppressive. The body&#039;s cooling mechanism\u2014evaporative cooling through perspiration\u2014doesn&#039;t work in high humidity. Air conditioning lowers temperature by removing heat, but it only removes humidity as a side effect of cooling.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If the air cools quickly\u2014because the system is oversized or the thermostat setpoint is met fast\u2014the compressor shuts off before the evaporator coil has time to condense moisture. The house cools, but stays humid.<\/p>\n\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull s-band s-band--ink has-contrast-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The chocolate factory adds a layer of complexity.<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group s-indent has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Hershey plant operates continuously, releasing moisture-laden exhaust into the surrounding air. On humid summer days, the smell of chocolate mixes with a sticky, thick atmosphere that air conditioners struggle to manage. Homes within a mile of the plant experience higher baseline humidity than those farther out, and their HVAC systems work harder to dehumidify.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Standard air conditioning, sized for temperature control alone, often short-cycles\u2014cooling the air quickly but shutting off before removing enough moisture. The result is a 72-degree house that feels clammy, with condensation on windows, mildew in bathrooms, and musty smells.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull s-band s-band--cream has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide s-stats is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-794e3cfa wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-stats__item is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"s-stats__number has-x-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">5-10%<\/p>\n\n<p class=\"s-stats__label wp-block-paragraph\">Humidity elevation within factory radius<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-stats__item is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"s-stats__number has-x-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">0.5-1 ton<\/p>\n\n<p class=\"s-stats__label wp-block-paragraph\">Typical undersizing in builder systems<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-stats__item is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"s-stats__number has-x-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">70-100<\/p>\n\n<p class=\"s-stats__label wp-block-paragraph\">Pints\/day whole-house units remove<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-stats__item is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"s-stats__number has-x-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">40%<\/p>\n\n<p class=\"s-stats__label wp-block-paragraph\">Energy savings with variable-speed<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull s-band s-band--sand has-tint-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Complete humidity and comfort solutions.<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide s-feature-row is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-794e3cfa wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-card s-feature-card is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium s-feature-card__img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-ductwork-1-1024x683.png\" alt=\"ductwork - professional HVAC service photo\" class=\"wp-image-1478\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-ductwork-1-1024x683.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-ductwork-1-300x200.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-ductwork-1-768x512.png 768w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-ductwork-1.png 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gpt-image-1)\">AI<\/span><\/figure>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Right-sized air conditioning<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Replace oversized systems with properly matched tonnage to extend run times and improve dehumidification without energy waste.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-card s-feature-card is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium s-feature-card__img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b.jpg\" alt=\"hvac technician repair\" class=\"wp-image-188\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b-300x225.jpg 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b-768x576.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--stock\" title=\"&quot;AC Service&quot; by SuperTech HVAC Services, BY-SA, via Openverse\">Stock<\/span><\/figure>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Whole-house dehumidification<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dedicated units work independently of cooling to remove 70\u2013100 pints daily, decoupling humidity control from temperature management.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-card s-feature-card is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium s-feature-card__img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-1-1024x683.png\" alt=\"technician - professional HVAC service photo\" class=\"wp-image-1475\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-1-1024x683.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-1-300x200.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-1-768x512.png 768w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-1.png 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gpt-image-1)\">AI<\/span><\/figure>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Variable-speed equipment<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Continuous modulation extends runtime, improves humidity removal, and cuts energy costs by 40% versus single-stage cycling.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-card s-feature-card is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium s-feature-card__img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-ductwork-1.png\" alt=\"ductwork - professional HVAC service photo\" class=\"wp-image-1759\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-ductwork-1.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-ductwork-1-300x300.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-ductwork-1-150x150.png 150w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-ductwork-1-768x768.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gemini-2.5-flash-image)\">AI<\/span><\/figure>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Energy recovery ventilation<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">ERV systems precondition incoming fresh air by transferring heat and moisture from exhaust, reducing HVAC system load.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-card s-feature-card is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium s-feature-card__img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-2-1024x683.png\" alt=\"technician - professional HVAC service photo\" class=\"wp-image-1476\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-2-1024x683.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-2-300x200.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-2-768x512.png 768w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-2.png 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gpt-image-1)\">AI<\/span><\/figure>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">HVAC zoning<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Independent upstairs and downstairs control eliminates hot\/cold spots and allows personalized comfort across the home.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-card s-feature-card is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium s-feature-card__img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-1.png\" alt=\"technician - professional HVAC service photo\" class=\"wp-image-1755\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-1.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-1-300x300.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-1-150x150.png 150w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-1-768x768.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gemini-2.5-flash-image)\">AI<\/span><\/figure>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Maintenance and optimization<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Regular filter changes, coil cleaning, and system tune-ups ensure equipment operates at peak efficiency year-round.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text has-media-on-the-right\" style=\"grid-template-columns:auto 50%\"><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How builder uniformity simplifies upgrades.<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Hershey&#039;s housing was designed with infrastructure in mind\u2014streets, utilities, and public buildings laid out according to a plan. This planning extended to the mechanical systems in homes, which followed consistent templates. While that uniformity simplifies HVAC work today, it also means that problems are systemic. Contractors who work regularly in Hershey develop expertise in these patterns and can deliver solutions that work across the housing stock.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A system design that works in one Colonial Revival on Cocoa Avenue likely works in a dozen others on the same block. This reduces guesswork, shortens installation time, and allows contractors to stock parts and equipment specific to Hershey&#039;s housing patterns.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Two-story Colonials with central stairs; ductwork typically runs through a central chase for straightforward upgrades<\/li>\n\n\n<li>Full basements with poured concrete walls and central furnace location; ideal for adding dehumidifiers or zone dampers<\/li>\n\n\n<li>Gable roofs with moderate pitch and full-width attics; consistent insulation upgrades across the housing stock<\/li>\n\n\n<li>Era-specific challenges predictable by construction date; 1920s-30s plaster walls need different approaches than 1950s drywall<\/li>\n\n<\/ul>\n\n<\/div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-2.png\" alt=\"technician - professional HVAC service photo\" class=\"wp-image-1756\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-2.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-2-300x300.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-2-150x150.png 150w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-2-768x768.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gemini-2.5-flash-image)\">AI<\/span><\/figure><\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull s-band s-band--sand has-tint-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Variable-speed systems work with zoning.<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Variable-speed technology\u2014found in furnace blowers, air conditioner compressors, and heat pump inverters\u2014changes how HVAC systems operate. Instead of cycling fully on and off, variable-speed equipment modulates capacity to match load. A furnace blower speeds up or slows down to deliver the precise airflow needed. An air conditioner compressor ramps up on hot days and dials back on mild ones, running almost continuously but at lower power.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This continuous operation, counterintuitively, saves energy because starting and stopping are the most inefficient phases of any motor&#039;s operation. In Hershey&#039;s climate, where humidity is as much a concern as temperature, variable-speed systems deliver measurable comfort improvements. Homeowners report that rooms feel more evenly conditioned, hot and cold spots disappear, and humidity stays comfortable without manual adjustments.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Zoning adds another layer: the upstairs and downstairs can be controlled independently, preventing one floor from overheating while the other is comfortable. Motorized dampers in the ductwork and a control board coordinate damper positions with thermostat signals, adding $1,500 to $2,500 to installation but delivering zone-by-zone precision.<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list s-pills s-pills--outline\">\n<li>Windows fog on the inside during AC season<\/li>\n\n\n<li>Musty closet smell despite clean house<\/li>\n\n\n<li>AC runs short cycles under 10 minutes<\/li>\n\n\n<li>Wood trim swelling in summer, shrinking in winter<\/li>\n\n\n<li>Allergy symptoms worse indoors than outside<\/li>\n\n<\/ul>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull s-band s-band--warm-gradient has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group s-overlap has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-10371125 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group s-overlap__img has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large alignwide\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/3053392372_47feda6a33_b.jpg\" alt=\"unfinished basement\" class=\"wp-image-192\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/3053392372_47feda6a33_b.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/3053392372_47feda6a33_b-300x225.jpg 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/3053392372_47feda6a33_b-768x576.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--stock\" title=\"&quot;Unfinished basement&quot; by Aaron Gustafson, BY-SA, via Openverse\">Stock<\/span><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group s-overlap__card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-bfed0f9d wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:2.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:2.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Factory humidity and planned community systems.<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Hershey chocolate plant is a major industrial operation, and its environmental footprint includes moisture release. The manufacturing process\u2014melting, mixing, cooling chocolate\u2014generates steam and humidity that exits through rooftop vents. On calm summer days, this moisture settles in surrounding neighborhoods, raising ambient humidity by several percentage points compared to areas farther out. The effect is most pronounced in homes downwind\u2014typically east and southeast.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">These homes see higher outdoor humidity entering through infiltration, open windows, and ventilation systems, which means their HVAC systems work harder to maintain comfortable indoor conditions. Homeowners in these zones often report that their air conditioners run constantly but the house never feels dry. The problem isn&#039;t the air conditioner\u2014it&#039;s the load. The system is fighting both internal moisture generation and elevated outdoor humidity.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Standard air conditioning can only dehumidify so much per cooling cycle, and if outdoor air is saturated, the system never catches up. Dedicated dehumidification breaks this cycle by addressing moisture directly, regardless of outdoor conditions. Ventilation systems should include energy recovery ventilators (ERVs) that precondition incoming air, reducing the humidity load on the HVAC system.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-element-heading has-text-align-center wp-block-heading\">Questions from Hershey homeowners.<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group s-accordion s-accordion--cards has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-1583283a wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary>Is the chocolate factory really affecting my home&#039;s humidity?<\/summary>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you live within a mile of the plant, especially downwind, yes. The plant&#039;s exhaust carries moisture, and on calm humid days, it settles in surrounding neighborhoods. This doesn&#039;t mean your HVAC system is broken\u2014it just means it&#039;s working against a higher baseline humidity load. Dedicated dehumidification or an ERV can offset this.<\/p>\n\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary>Should I replace my air conditioner if it cools but doesn&#039;t dehumidify?<\/summary>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Not necessarily. The issue is often oversizing or short cycling, not equipment failure. A properly sized unit with longer run times, or a variable-speed system that modulates capacity, will dehumidify better without replacement. If the existing unit is oversized, downsizing at the next replacement will improve comfort.<\/p>\n\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary>What&#039;s the best way to improve comfort in a Hershey Colonial?<\/summary>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Start with the envelope\u2014attic insulation, air sealing, and window treatments to reduce solar gain. Then address HVAC: right-sized variable-speed equipment, whole-house dehumidification, and zoning if upstairs and downstairs have different comfort needs. These upgrades work together to deliver stable temperature and humidity.<\/p>\n\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary>How much does whole-house dehumidification cost?<\/summary>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A whole-house dehumidifier with installation typically ranges from $1,500 to $2,500, depending on capacity and model. This is significantly more cost-effective than running multiple portable units throughout the home. For homes in Hershey&#039;s humid microclimate, the investment pays back quickly in comfort and reduced mold risk.<\/p>\n\n<\/details>\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-aa34ec83 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:2rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:2rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group s-cta--inline has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-965f9c1f wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:1.5rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:1.5rem;padding-left:2rem\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If your Chocolate Avenue\u2013area home has the original builder-grade system from the planned community era, a capacity check will show what it&#039;s actually delivering now. <a href=\"\/contact\/\">Schedule the equipment review<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group s-nearby has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Also serving nearby:<\/strong> <a href=\"\/living-near-the-susquehanna-means-humidity-here-is-how-harrisburg-homes-beat-it\/\">Harrisburg<\/a> \u00b7 <a href=\"\/heating-a-lebanon-home-on-a-fixed-budget-what-pays-off-first\/\">Lebanon<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-element-heading has-text-align-center wp-block-heading\">Our Work in Your Neighborhood<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery alignwide has-nested-images columns-3 is-cropped s-gallery wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" data-id=\"188\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b.jpg\" alt=\"hvac technician repair\" class=\"wp-image-188\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b-300x225.jpg 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b-768x576.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--stock\" title=\"&quot;AC Service&quot; by SuperTech HVAC Services, BY-SA, via Openverse\">Stock<\/span><\/figure>\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"357\" data-id=\"191\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/3359389452_125c1ce535_b.jpg\" alt=\"unfinished basement\" class=\"wp-image-191\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-conte