t, properly sized and installed, can deliver the comfort that Milton Hershey&#039;s original vision promised\u2014even when the chocolate factory next door adds a little extra humidity to the air.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-35f06ea7 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/contact\/\">Schedule the Humidity Audit<\/a><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--3\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"tel:+1\">Call Now<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"s-credits has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Photos: AI-generated (gemini-2.5-flash-image) \u00b7 AI-generated (gpt-image-1) \u00b7 &quot;Unfinished basement&quot; by Aaron Gustafson, BY-SA, via Openverse<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Hershey&#8217;s planned community housing faces humidity challenges from the nearby chocolate factory. Dehumidification and variable-speed HVAC solutions restore comfort.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":0,"featured_media":1794,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"location","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"_angie_page":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-128","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.0 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>The Chocolate Factory Makes Your Hershey Home Humid \u2014 Not Sweet - Keystone Comfort Co.<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Hershey&#039;s planned community housing faces humidity challenges from the nearby chocolate factory. Dehumidification and variable-speed HVAC solutions restore comfort.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max